// IntroString :
"P1260264599" "So DJ Zero had you go acquire Cupid's bow and an Arrow of Love? Seems like a solid plan. Now we need to catch up to Red Widow before she's killed by Arbiter Daos' forces. Once you see her, you need to shoot her with the arrow.<br><br><color orange>The Arrow of Love power will be given to you at the start of this mission.</color><br><br>Hopefully the Arrow will cause her to fall in love with Recluse all over again and we can salvage this plan once and for all."
// AcceptString :
"P2307924730" "I like the part where I am no longer going to die."
// SendOffString :
"P1905198805" "Yes, it might take a couple weeks but the blood bond between you two will fade, but right now it's still going strong and you'll die if she dies, so you had better hurry and shoot her with that arrow while you both are still breathing."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4114685546" "Travel to Grandville, Shoot Red Widow with Arrow of Love"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2218348872" "Time is of the essence here, {HeroName}. The longer you wait, the more chance Arbiter Daos has of killing Red Widow, taking YOU with her!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"

