// 5 Actor2 :
"P2822073143" "<t=5 d=5 welcome>Welcome to my tower, Marlene."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2066919920" "<t=5 d=5 em thanks>Tell me, do you still retain the desire to end my life?"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1688483625" "<t=5 d=5 em no>No, Stefan, I've returned to normal."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3166754149" "<t=5 d=5>Excellent, that idiotic 'Cupid's Arrow' worked after all."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3804594252" "<t=5 d=5>I'll have to thank Liberty for her hard work."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1991288858" "<t=5 d=5 em explain>The organization has changed greatly since my demise, Stefan..."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P4100177593" "<t=5 d=5>Yes, your presence helps me realize that I have strayed from my... original goals when I founded Arachnos. But no longer..."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3008637605" "<t=5 d=5>Your resurrection will usher in a new age for Arachnos, where we shall change the face of the world with our order and our technology!"

